Z||000007||theogre||05-03-2000||02:56 PM||||yes, the switch or the dimmer knob could do it. put the old ones back in.||||reg||1
Z||000008||batboy||05-03-2000||03:00 PM||||Yes it can. Make sure that's plugged in tight too. I forgot about that. They can go bad.||||reg||1
